# Sparki Academy — product & compliance

**Product:** COPPA-compliant edtech for ages 3–11. **Human Tutor** = real-time AI avatar via **LiveAvatar FULL Mode** (liveavatar.com). **Live:** sparkiedu.com.

## Absolute rules

1. **COPPA:** Children are never account holders; all accounts are **parent** accounts.
2. **COPPA — tutor:** Tutor only if `children.tutor_enabled === true` **and** parent has an **active** subscription (verify before issuing tokens).
3. **Security:** `LIVEAVATAR_API_KEY` (and all LiveAvatar secrets) are **server-only** — never `NEXT_PUBLIC_*`, never client bundles.
4. **Security:** Token generation routes **always** verify subscription (and child ownership / flags) before calling LiveAvatar.
5. **Sessions:** Hard cap **25 messages per tutor session** (enforce in app logic when chat/messaging exists).
6. **Child-facing UI:** Minimum **20px** body text, minimum **48px** touch targets, **no external links** visible to children.

## LiveAvatar (v1) — use this, not HeyGen streaming

- Token: `POST https://api.liveavatar.com/v1/sessions/token`
- Start: `POST https://api.liveavatar.com/v1/sessions/start`
- Client SDK: `@heygen/liveavatar-web-sdk`
- **Do not use:** `@heygen/streaming-avatar` (deprecated; do not add or recommend).

## Stack reference (canonical)

Next.js 14 App Router, TypeScript strict, Supabase (auth + Postgres + storage), Stripe (subscriptions), Tailwind only, Vercel. Primary app path: `sparki-academy-next/`.
